# The keys that may sign a release tag (docs/runbooks/repo.md, Releases).
# release.yaml reads this file as main holds it and refuses a tag that no
# key here signed. One line per key, in the format of ssh-keygen's
# ALLOWED SIGNERS:
#
#   <e-mail of the tagger> namespaces="git" <key type> <public key>
#
# The owner adds their own signing key here in a pull request of its own.
# No key is listed yet, so no release can be made until one is.
